      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MASTER KILCOY (1) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a one length second (20.31) behind Ada Blaze at this track. Can go on with it. I'M MY DESIGN (4) had been going along well winning a Other three back then placing at this track before missing the frame latest when fifth (21.07) at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. LIFE'S A JOURNEY (5) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (20.13) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from nine attempts. Hard to beat again. SHE'S GOT DESIGN (8) has been in the frame at her last two runs, most recently when third (20.13) in a Other over 342m at this track.",
